//- The skemo pipeline, drawn by skemo
diagram(dir="right" lang="en")

  card#agent.ai(icon="bot") Your AI agent
    | writes a few hundred tokens of text
    to(source)

  card#source.text(icon="file-code") diagram.skemo
    | cards, zones, arrows
    | types styled in CSS
    to(engine)

  zone#cpu.local skemo, on your CPU
    card#engine.step(icon="cpu") Layout + routing
      | deterministic, offline
      to(out) ~50 ms

  card#out.output(icon="image") PNG · SVG · WebP · HTML
    | light, dark and print
